Further to my earlier emails about 42 Brackenveil Row, Oakhollow (peeling kitchen-cabinet laminate with sharp edges, and doors that do not close).

The landlord has asked for up-to-date written estimates for two alternatives:
1. A full new kitchen.
2. Replacement cupboards and doors only.

